# Force LF so a Windows clone does not rewrite every file.
#
# Git's `core.autocrlf` on this machine converts text files to CRLF on checkout. That
# would (a) make every published file differ from what the build intended byte for
# byte and (b) put CRLF into `.js` files that are read on Linux/Android. Normalising
# here keeps the repository's content identical across all three platforms.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.ts text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf

# Binary or generated files that must stay untouched.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.woff2 binary
